WEBVTT

01:29.539 --> 01:33.170
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.680 --> 01:36.050
[Episode 11]

01:37.120 --> 01:38.240
Ms. Kou,

01:38.280 --> 01:39.000
I advise you to sign

01:39.000 --> 01:41.410
and put your fingerprint
on Xie Quan's confession of guilt

01:41.410 --> 01:43.800
-sooner rather than later.
-Mr. Xie is modest and courteous,

01:43.800 --> 01:45.060
of upright character.

01:45.080 --> 01:46.360
He would never do

01:46.360 --> 01:48.000
such heinous things.

01:48.520 --> 01:49.320
Hmph.

01:49.500 --> 01:51.360
Such an unbreakable bond of love.

01:51.520 --> 01:52.120
Guards,

01:52.240 --> 01:53.120
beat her!

01:58.289 --> 02:00.120
[Xie Mansion]

02:00.440 --> 02:03.940
[Xie Mansion]

02:01.420 --> 02:02.590
Half a year later,

02:02.960 --> 02:05.160
the matter with Prince Xu came to an end.

02:05.160 --> 02:07.080
Ms. Kou was released,

02:07.780 --> 02:09.900
but having endured brutal torture,

02:07.860 --> 02:09.270
[Xie Mansion]

02:10.280 --> 02:11.610
she was covered in scars

02:12.010 --> 02:13.660
[Xie Mansion]

02:12.130 --> 02:12.960
and left with a broken body.

02:12.960 --> 02:13.920
Hey, what are you doing?

02:13.920 --> 02:14.880
Get out.

02:15.240 --> 02:17.530
Where did you come from, you beggar?

02:17.680 --> 02:18.950
Do you know where this is?

02:18.950 --> 02:19.920
How dare you barge in here?

02:19.920 --> 02:22.870
I'm looking for Mr. Xie Quan.

02:22.900 --> 02:25.560
Our Mr. Xie has married into
the Princess Mansion.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.380
He doesn't live here.

02:26.380 --> 02:28.050
You stinking beggar,

02:28.079 --> 02:29.480
why don't you take a look at yourself
in the mirror?

02:29.480 --> 02:31.760
Do you think the Prince Consort is
someone you can just ask to meet?

02:31.760 --> 02:33.160
When did he marry into
the Princess Mansion?

02:33.160 --> 02:33.960
Get out of here right now!

02:33.250 --> 02:36.829
[Xie Mansion]

02:34.000 --> 02:36.210
What are you arguing about?

02:36.230 --> 02:37.810
What's the noise?

02:42.320 --> 02:43.120
The hairpin.

02:43.640 --> 02:45.200
This is my hairpin.

02:45.200 --> 02:47.760
This was a reward from our master.

02:47.840 --> 02:49.360
What's it to you?

02:50.970 --> 02:51.910
Ru Yue.

02:52.400 --> 02:53.400
You are Ru Yue.

02:53.480 --> 02:54.640
I am Ms. Kou.

02:54.640 --> 02:56.079
I'm not Ru Yue.

02:56.120 --> 02:56.920
You got the wrong person.

02:56.920 --> 02:57.850
I am Ms. Kou.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.350
Go, go, go, go!

02:58.350 --> 02:58.880
-Hurry up!
-Ru Yue.

02:58.880 --> 03:00.480
Go, go, go, go!

03:01.610 --> 03:06.860
[Xie Mansion]

03:07.240 --> 03:08.910
[Xie Mansion]

03:09.400 --> 03:12.650
To extricate himself from the matter
involving Prince Xu,

03:12.650 --> 03:15.100
Xie Quan ultimately chose to marry into
the Princess Mansion.

03:12.970 --> 03:14.680
[Xie Mansion]

03:15.940 --> 03:18.040
And Ms. Kou's savings

03:18.070 --> 03:20.270
were swindled away by her own maid.

03:21.829 --> 03:23.950
Poor thing,
during those six months in prison,

03:23.720 --> 03:31.220
[Xie Mansion]

03:24.600 --> 03:28.079
she had been foolishly clinging to
those so-called promises.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.840
Don't you think

03:32.560 --> 03:34.000
that this Ms. Kou

03:35.440 --> 03:37.570
is the most foolish woman in the world?

03:39.240 --> 03:40.400
Then I want to know;

03:40.880 --> 03:42.520
what happened to that heartless man

03:42.520 --> 03:43.810
and that ungrateful maid

03:43.810 --> 03:44.810
in the end?

03:44.880 --> 03:45.680
Oh.

03:49.400 --> 03:51.720
One year, on the fifteenth day

03:51.880 --> 03:55.100
of the first lunar month,

03:55.480 --> 03:57.280
people found the severed arms,

03:57.920 --> 03:59.450
legs, and heads

04:00.150 --> 04:02.100
of the Prince Consort Xie

04:02.680 --> 04:03.440
and Ru Yue

04:04.560 --> 04:06.160
scattered all over the city.

04:14.880 --> 04:16.589
After hearing my story,

04:18.160 --> 04:20.160
do you still believe in promises?

04:21.640 --> 04:23.780
Sweet words come from no loyal lips.

04:23.960 --> 04:26.620
The fickle world abounds
with smooth‑talkers.

04:27.800 --> 04:28.860
It's getting late.

04:28.920 --> 04:29.880
I advise you

04:30.040 --> 04:31.360
to take this gold.

04:32.760 --> 04:35.960
I will have someone
escort you safely to the fourth level.

04:38.720 --> 04:40.320
You've finished your story.

04:40.320 --> 04:41.840
I have a story too.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.340
This ring,

04:47.020 --> 04:48.460
do you remember it?

04:48.600 --> 04:50.860
This is the guiding ring of Lingya Tower.

04:51.070 --> 04:52.430
Where did you get it?

04:53.140 --> 04:54.520
Ten years ago,

04:54.960 --> 04:58.240
Lingya Tower sent an assassin
who killed my father.

04:58.260 --> 04:59.980
My mother was also poisoned
with a strange toxin,

04:59.980 --> 05:01.160
and has been unconscious ever since.

05:01.160 --> 05:03.000
And this ring

05:03.280 --> 05:05.800
was left behind by the killer then.

05:05.820 --> 05:07.420
I fought my way up the Tower

05:07.520 --> 05:09.800
and learned
that the killer was voice-keeper Taiyin.

05:09.800 --> 05:10.660
And she

05:11.320 --> 05:13.120
is right here on the third level.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.920
Are you saying

05:15.290 --> 05:16.250
that I am

05:16.760 --> 05:18.560
the one who killed your father?

05:18.560 --> 05:19.360
That's right.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.600
I should kill you
with my own hands right now

05:21.600 --> 05:22.690
to avenge them,

05:23.200 --> 05:25.130
but my Master repeatedly warned me

05:25.440 --> 05:27.080
not to act recklessly.

05:28.480 --> 05:29.840
So on some matters,

05:31.080 --> 05:33.440
I decided to ask you face to face.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.440
Your Master,

05:37.760 --> 05:38.720
Zhuang Wujiu?

05:42.460 --> 05:43.920
What else did she tell you?

05:45.159 --> 05:46.680
Are you suspecting

05:46.880 --> 05:48.360
that the voice-keeper on the third level

05:48.360 --> 05:50.420
is the one who murdered your parents?

05:51.400 --> 05:53.020
That man with a hairpin

05:53.080 --> 05:54.640
is so ruthless.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.280
How could he not be

05:56.280 --> 05:57.400
the voice-keeper Taiyin.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.200
Yes

05:59.960 --> 06:00.760
and no.

06:01.160 --> 06:02.360
What do you mean?

06:03.320 --> 06:04.780
Let me take you somewhere.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.680
Zan Hua

06:08.080 --> 06:09.480
is not the voice-keeper.

06:22.820 --> 06:24.010
I've been here before.

06:24.010 --> 06:25.240
Isn't this where female prisoners

06:25.240 --> 06:26.400
are enslaved to mint coins?

06:26.400 --> 06:27.200
Exactly.

06:27.920 --> 06:28.720
Look closely.

06:35.260 --> 06:36.500
No!

06:36.760 --> 06:37.840
Ah!

06:39.960 --> 06:40.720
Hey!

06:40.810 --> 06:44.070
Isn't that the female prisoner
who played the Golden Cave?

06:44.280 --> 06:45.540
She's still alive.

06:49.520 --> 06:51.080
By order of Tower Master,

06:51.080 --> 06:52.600
the voice-keeper mints new coins here.

06:52.600 --> 06:54.850
Smelting gold requires excavating caves.

06:54.850 --> 06:56.190
Later she discovered

06:56.220 --> 06:58.320
that by using the complex
and varied cave structures,

06:58.320 --> 07:00.200
she could hide female prisoners in them,

07:00.200 --> 07:01.160
making them hard to find,

07:01.160 --> 07:03.640
so she started
helping these female prisoners

07:03.640 --> 07:04.520
fake their deaths

07:04.520 --> 07:05.820
to deceive everyone.

07:07.180 --> 07:09.480
Even if she has found her conscience now,

07:09.520 --> 07:10.570
it doesn't prove

07:10.600 --> 07:12.520
that she isn't the one
who murdered my parents.

07:12.520 --> 07:14.060
On the entire third level,

07:14.360 --> 07:16.000
apart from the voice-keeper,

07:16.000 --> 07:16.920
there is no one else

07:16.920 --> 07:18.000
with that ability.

07:23.520 --> 07:25.280
She even told you all this.

07:28.680 --> 07:29.480
I know

07:29.950 --> 07:31.510
you've saved many people.

07:31.760 --> 07:33.280
But when facing an enemy,

07:33.360 --> 07:35.370
I will never show mercy.

07:35.400 --> 07:36.530
The answer you want,

07:37.280 --> 07:38.760
I can tell you right now.

07:40.880 --> 07:42.850
I am not the voice-keeper Taiyin,

07:43.159 --> 07:46.440
and this ring is not mine.

07:47.880 --> 07:50.570
All guiding rings
for voice-keepers of Lingya Tower

07:50.570 --> 07:53.210
are sized for the left ring finger.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.680
The size of this ring...

07:58.880 --> 07:59.960
See?

08:00.830 --> 08:03.000
It shows the owner's finger

08:03.260 --> 08:04.720
is much thinner than mine.

08:14.720 --> 08:16.160
I apologize for my offense just now.

08:16.160 --> 08:17.520
Please forgive me,

08:17.650 --> 08:18.330
Ms. Kou.

08:20.920 --> 08:21.840
Zan,

08:22.000 --> 08:23.000
put the sword down.

08:23.000 --> 08:23.760
Wan,

08:24.330 --> 08:27.460
it would be one thing
if she were just an ordinary person,

08:27.640 --> 08:28.880
but she's with Zhuang Wujiu.

08:28.880 --> 08:30.320
I can't let her leave.

08:30.320 --> 08:30.920
Zan,

08:31.080 --> 08:32.539
let her go.

08:32.720 --> 08:34.820
Are you not even going to listen to me?

08:36.799 --> 08:38.559
You previously hid the truth
from Tower Master,

08:38.559 --> 08:40.620
mixing impurities into the coinage,

08:40.679 --> 08:42.240
secretly transferring the remaining gold

08:42.240 --> 08:44.000
to Zhuang Wujiu for transport.

08:44.000 --> 08:45.280
That alone is a capital offense!

08:45.280 --> 08:47.880
If it weren't for her
repeatedly bewitching you,

08:47.880 --> 08:50.540
how could you have done
such a rebellious thing?

08:50.840 --> 08:51.720
Listen to me.

08:51.720 --> 08:53.360
Let's capture this person

08:53.360 --> 08:54.840
and report to Tower Master.

08:54.840 --> 08:56.700
Maybe we can make amends for our crimes.

08:56.700 --> 08:57.610
Zan

08:57.760 --> 08:58.760
Zan, don't.

09:00.480 --> 09:01.280
Kou Wan.

09:02.400 --> 09:05.200
Lingya Tower has always been brutal
and ruthless.

09:05.280 --> 09:06.440
Having been here for so many years,

09:06.440 --> 09:07.900
how could we not know that?

09:08.400 --> 09:09.680
Even if you grab her and run,

09:09.680 --> 09:11.400
I still can't escape death.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.280
Releasing the female prisoners

09:13.960 --> 09:16.450
is an act of redemption
I truly wanted to do.

09:16.520 --> 09:18.650
It has nothing to do with Zhuang Wujiu.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.320
Even if I die,

09:21.370 --> 09:23.540
I could never be a treacherous person.

09:42.440 --> 09:44.600
Why did Master summon me

09:44.770 --> 09:45.850
overnight?

09:47.220 --> 09:49.080
There are two chests of gold here.

09:49.080 --> 09:51.360
This chest is the one I sealed previously.

09:51.360 --> 09:53.960
And this one is what you delivered
two days ago.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.600
Forgive my ignorance, Master.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.460
I do not understand what you mean.

09:58.490 --> 10:00.260
Then watch closely.

10:24.760 --> 10:26.040
I failed in my duty of supervision.

10:26.040 --> 10:27.770
I deserve ten thousand deaths.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.170
What happened?

10:39.170 --> 10:41.480
The adulteration of the gold coins
has been discovered.

10:41.480 --> 10:43.040
Tower Master is coming to punish us.

10:43.040 --> 10:45.610
I've arranged everything else.

10:45.640 --> 10:46.900
Leave with me quickly.

10:47.720 --> 10:48.520
I can't leave.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.840
If I leave,

10:49.920 --> 10:51.280
Tower Master will blame

10:51.280 --> 10:53.080
everything on Zan.

10:53.120 --> 10:53.530
What's more,

10:53.530 --> 10:55.440
the female prisoners we painstakingly hid

10:55.440 --> 10:56.650
will certainly die.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.320
I will do my best to mediate

10:58.320 --> 10:59.080
and keep everyone safe.

10:59.080 --> 11:00.340
But if you don't leave,

11:00.400 --> 11:01.620
you will die.

11:05.200 --> 11:07.000
Sorry, Zhuang Wujiu.

11:08.280 --> 11:10.740
This needle will put you
to sleep for a while.

11:13.720 --> 11:14.760
Zhuang Wujiu.

11:14.880 --> 11:17.320
There is absolutely no way
I can escape unscathed this time.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.440
Only my death

11:19.240 --> 11:20.520
can ensure all your safety.

11:20.520 --> 11:22.110
You and I still have unfinished business.

11:22.110 --> 11:22.840
You can't...

11:22.840 --> 11:23.640
Zhuang Wujiu.

11:23.880 --> 11:24.540
Promise me.

11:24.640 --> 11:26.400
Those gold coins we hid away,

11:26.400 --> 11:27.470
you must guard them well.

11:27.470 --> 11:29.790
And if someday those female prisoners

11:30.320 --> 11:32.520
manage to leave Lingya Tower alive,

11:33.160 --> 11:34.450
I leave them in your care.
